# 📊 Key Analysis Performed

## ✅ Data Cleaning
- Removed duplicate records
- Handled missing values
- Removed unnecessary columns
- Standardized datasets for analysis

## ✅ Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
- Top run scorers analysis
- Top wicket takers analysis
- Cross-format batting comparison
- Bowling performance analysis
- Player efficiency metrics
- Statistical trend analysis

## ✅ Data Visualization
- Bar charts
- Correlation heatmaps
- Comparative analysis graphs
- Performance distribution charts

---

# 📈 Key Insights
- Identified the highest-performing batsmen across formats
- Analyzed wicket-taking dominance among bowlers
- Compared average performance across ODI, Test, and T20 cricket
- Created player efficiency metrics using statistical calculations
- Explored relationships between multiple cricket performance indicators

